{
  "vulnerable_symbols": [],
  "trigger": "安装或 require flatmap-stream@0.1.1（或依赖 event-stream@3.3.6）即执行恶意代码，无需特定外部输入；在 Copay 构建环境中会窃取私钥。",
  "exploit_evidence": [
    {
      "src": 1,
      "kind": "in_the_wild",
      "quote": "A new maintainer of the popular event-stream npm package added a malicious sub-dependency, flatmap-stream, that exfiltrated cryptocurrency wallet seeds from Copay-derived applications."
    },
    {
      "src": 2,
      "kind": "in_the_wild",
      "quote": "前几天,开源项目event-stream的维护者将恶意代码注入到了依赖项flatmap-stream中,目的为定向窃取使用比特币项目Copay的用户密码私钥等信息以间接盗取比特币,该事件一经曝光就在国内外比特币和开源社区引起广泛讨论。"
    },
    {
      "src": 5,
      "kind": "in_the_wild",
      "quote": "On September 9, 2018, a trusted maintainer of the npm package event-stream added a dependency called flatmap-stream@0.1.1 that used the importing package's own npm description field as a decryption key to unpack and eval() an obfuscated payload in memory — code built specifically to steal private keys from the Copay bitcoin wallet's build pipeline."
    }
  ],
  "fixed_version": "",
  "summary_zh": "flatmap-stream@0.1.1 是恶意包，引入即窃密，请立即移除该依赖。"
}
